# Path of Building — Agent Rules

For architectural context and the current status, read `port-plan/STATUS.md`
first, then the active phase file it names. (The `.obsidian-vault/01_Wiki/` notes
referenced here previously do not exist — removed.)

Prefer the code-review-graph MCP tools for codebase exploration before Grep/Glob
(see `CLAUDE.md`).

When the user refers to "launching the app" (or similar phrasing like "run the
app", "start the GUI", "open the program"), they mean the Qt/QML port (entry
`app/src/main.cpp` + host `app/lua/pob_host.lua`, binary `build-win/pob-qt.exe`)
unless they explicitly say "legacy". Do NOT assume the legacy SimpleGraphic GUI
(`src/Launch.lua`) unless the word "legacy" is specified.
